*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
/deps/deps.jl
/docs/build
# ⚠️ **No manifest is ever committed.** One resolved on a Mac pins versions and
# artifacts that do not replay elsewhere, and a machine that pulls it gets a
# broken `instantiate` with no clue why. Every environment resolves its own.
Manifest.toml

# Generated by the visualisation scripts — regenerable, and large.
# `scripts/film_images.jl` → film.jls ; `scripts/film.jl` → *.mp4
# `scripts/figure52.jl`    → figure52.png, figure52.jls
*.log
*.jls
/*.mp4
/*.gif
/*.png
!docs/src/assets/*.png
!docs/src/assets/*.gif
!docs/src/assets/*.mp4
